Patches applied to the official Difix trainer (github.com/nv-tlabs/Difix3D, commit c76edc595586e16732c91ddee82f3a6d83a8a9cc,
files src/dataset.py and src/train_difix.py) for the matched comparison of docs/difix_reimpl_validation.md.
Apply in a clone of that commit: git apply src/fixers/difix_reimpl/official_trainer.patch
The trainer's max_train_steps does not stop training (it only sets the scheduler); we stopped it after step 1,801.

